What is Anime and Cartoon Character Licensing?
Anime and cartoon character licensing involves granting permission to third-party companies to use intellectual properties from animated productions across various consumer goods and services. This licensing model enables the production of merchandise such as toys, apparel, accessories, and video games featuring these characters, extending their commercial reach beyond original TV shows or films while creating lucrative revenue streams for rights holders.
